  <span class="tag">Proposed meetup</span>
  <h1><span class="q">q</span>London 2027</h1>
  <p class="tagline">One language. Many implementations.</p>
  <p>We're exploring a London meetup in early 2027 bringing together the different implementations of the q programming language.</p>
  <p>Expect technical talks, demos and an opportunity to meet the wider q community.</p>
  <p><strong>Interested in attending? Register your interest below.</strong></p>
  <p class="small">Date and venue to be confirmed.</p>
</div></section>
<section class="section" id="register" style="padding-top:20px"><div class="container register">
<form class="card contact-form" id="interestForm" method="post" action="register.php"<?= $registered ? ' hidden' : '' ?>>
  <input type="hidden" name="formtoken" value="<?= $token ?>">
  <div class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true">
    <label>Leave this field empty <input type="text" name="company_url" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label>
  </div>
  <span class="tag">Expression of interest</span>
  <h2>Register your interest.</h2>
  <p class="small">This is not a booking. We'll gauge interest first and write to you if the event goes ahead.</p>
  <div class="form-grid">
    <label>Name
      <input name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="90" required>
    </label>
    <label>Email
      <input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="60" required>
    </label>
    <label class="wide">Company (optional)
      <input name="company" autocomplete="organization" maxlength="200">
    </label>
  </div>
  <div class="contact-form-actions">
    <button class="button peach-button" type="submit" id="interestSubmit">Register interest</button>
  </div>
  <div class="form-status" id="interestStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
  <p class="small privacy">Privacy: we'll use your email only to send updates about this proposed event. It won't be added to any general marketing list.</p>
